{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20112","headline":"和薛先辈送独孤秀才上都赴嘉会得青字 · 孟郊","name":"和薛先辈送独孤秀才上都赴嘉会得青字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秦云攀窈窕，楚桂搴芳馨。\n五色岂徒尔，万枝皆有灵。\n仙谣天上贵，林咏雪中青。\n持此一爲赠，送君翔杳冥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20112.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20112","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}